            sentence this paragraph did, HOLO_LINE and HOLO_NAME_LINE included,
            read from the same constants. What is left here is a pointer, which
            is what a lane owes a word it uses and does not define. */}
        {/* ── "REMOVED" MEANS GONE, AND THIS IS THE CASE THAT PROVED IT ─────
            The founder struck the holo paragraph on 2026-08-31. It came back
            SHORTER — "✧ is holo, the payers' keepsake — what it is, and what a
