                lifecycle stage visually on the site, if ideas in that stage
                exist"). `byStage` in civic.mjs owns the order and the split;
                the page has no rule of its own about either. */}
            {/* BY · CLAIM · ONE ✦ LINE · ONE ACTION, and nothing else — the
