            commit 6b235216, 13:55 on 2026-08-30 — superseded at 17:21 the SAME
            DAY by e383e992 ("the Think Tank stands"), which rewrote it to route
            an idea to the tank instead of straight to the chest.

            THE PIN WAS NEVER BEHIND. `0b4616cc`, the world this site is built
